# Direct dependencies. Edit THIS file, then regenerate requirements.txt:
#   sh scripts/lock-deps.sh            (see the script for the Docker one-liner)
# requirements.txt is the lock file: every package, transitive ones included, pinned with hashes.
#
# Floors = past known CVEs and at least the major.minor the test suite last passed with.
# Ceilings = the next major/minor that may break things; Dependabot proposes raising them.

